---
description: Testing and evaluation conventions
globs: tests/**/*
---
- **Unit test structure**: use `# Arrange`, `# Act`, `# Assert` comments in Python `tests/unittest`, live eval `tests/suit`, and UI `*.test.ts(x)` files (combined lines OK for one-liners)
- **Eval**: `make eval-live` retrieval IR (Pydantic Evals); `make eval-live-generation` → `python tests/suit/run_generation_eval.py` (DeepEval `evaluate()`, `EVAL_MODE=live`, running stack). Suit tests narrate the quality contract (docstring); goldens in `dataset.json`
- **Repo map drift**: structural changes must update root `project.cue` and pass `make verify-repo-map` ([ADR 008](../docs/adr/008-repo-metadata-in-cue.md))
- **In-service tests are unit only** (no `tests/integration/` under services) — HTTP acceptance is `tests/api`; see [ADR 004](../docs/adr/004-no-in-service-integration-tests.md)
- **Default CI is unit-only** — no docker-compose, `tests/api`, `tests/e2e`, or `eval-live`; see [ADR 007](../docs/adr/007-no-live-tests-in-ci.md) (demo/reference project, not production revenue software)
- API Gherkin (`tests/api`): Playwright-BDD against live api/chat/admin; steps use **only** clients generated from `openapi/*.yaml`; `make test-api`; manual / on-demand
- Eval layout: `tests/eval/src/agentic_eval/` is a generic core package (`core/goldendata/` + `core/deepeval/judge_model`, `HostStack` protocol, `modules/retrieval` Pydantic Evals IR, `modules/generation` chat-graph SUT). Live stack wiring is `tests/eval/tests/suit/` (`settings.py`, pytest `suit` fixture). pytest: `tests/unittest/` offline; `tests/suit/test_retrieval_eval.py` live IR; generation is `tests/suit/run_generation_eval.py` (parallel chat-graph SUT, then one DeepEval `evaluate()` on a TTY — not `deepeval test run` / pytest, which hide the progress bar). Goldens: `dataset.json`; allowed source files on `GoldenSettings` (`EVAL_GOLDEN_*`). Retrieval ranking is not DeepEval contextual precision/recall
- Goldens are grounded in `resources/` PDFs (not the repo itself). Typed as `LabeledGolden | AbstentionGolden`. Tier 1 IR: Recall@k, Precision@k, Hit Rate@k, MRR, nDCG@k on labeled `expected_source_file`. Tier 2 generation: labeled goldens in one DeepEval `evaluate()` call (Faithfulness / Answer Relevancy, one progress bar) plus refusal checks — judge via LiteLLM `judge` alias (`EVAL_JUDGE_MODEL`), not the `generate` model; not DeepEval contextual precision/recall. SUT fan-out is `EVAL_MAX_CONCURRENCY` (default 20). Judge is serial: `EVAL_JUDGE_MAX_CONCURRENCY` (default 1), `EVAL_JUDGE_THROTTLE_SECONDS` (default 2), metrics `async_mode=False`, plus `DEEPEVAL_RETRY_*` (10 attempts / 60s cap) so gpt-4o 429s are not quality FAILs under LiteLLM `rpm: 30`
- Eval config is `EvalSettings` (`EVAL_` prefix + nested module gates). Live SUT endpoints are suite `SutSettings` (`EVAL_SUT_*` URLs, localhost defaults — not compose DNS, not `os.environ` rewrites). `EVAL_SUT_QDRANT_COLLECTION` must match the stack's `QDRANT_COLLECTION` (session fixture fail-fasts if missing). The pytest `suit` fixture in `tests/suit/conftest.py` loads `tests/eval/.env` via pydantic-settings (copy `.env.example`; do not `source` it — bash mangles JSON). Proxy bearer is `OPENAI_API_KEY` or `EVAL_SUT_LITELLM_API_KEY` in that file (same token as repo-root `OPENAI_API_KEY` / `LITELLM_MASTER_KEY`); empty values are ignored.
- **LangSmith** prod tracing: `LANGSMITH_ENABLED=true` on chat service (LangGraph auto-traces)
- Test profiles: Dagger functions in `tools/ops` (`test-unit`, `test-all`); `make test-profiles`
- E2E UI: `tests/e2e` (Playwright + Gherkin); not in default CI; `npm test` is fast by default, `npm run test:demo` for slow human-like video
